{%- doc -%}
  Single Featured-Stage banner — a bare 1280:680 clickable image that
  links to a product's PDP. The image is treated as required (admin
  must upload a designed promo banner via the image_picker); if it's
  missing the banner doesn't render so we never fall back to a square
  product thumbnail that would crop awkwardly into the wide frame.

  @param {object} product - Product object that this banner links to
  @param {image}  image   - Admin-uploaded banner image (1280×680)
{%- enddoc -%}

{%- if image != blank and product != blank and product.url != blank -%}
  {%- comment -%}
    Width/height come from the uploaded image's natural dimensions so
    the browser reserves the correct space (no CLS) regardless of the
    aspect ratio the admin uploads.
  {%- endcomment -%}
  <a class="apgo-event-featured-banner" href="{{ product.url }}" aria-label="{{ product.title | escape }}">
    <img
      class="apgo-event-featured-banner__img"
      src="{{ image | image_url: width: 1600 }}"
      alt="{{ product.title | escape }}"
      loading="lazy"
      width="{{ image.width }}"
      height="{{ image.height }}">
  </a>
{%- endif -%}
